==== OEM bootlog - Unlocked ====
Glitching the UART lockdown: Solder a little pulse-switch between HOLD# of the Flash-Chip and GND... and pulse it various times in the bootchain (while it's loading image2 and even when the boot progresses). Eventually it will print out alot of information... When you see the "CM>"-prompt it means that you won :)
Also attached are two possible scenarios that show you that your pulsings of the switch were not correct.

